{
  "purpose": "The version of each DNS program that an operating-system release shipped, and which signers each distribution family carries at all. Operators mostly meet a new default through the OS package rather than the upstream tarball, so these dates are the 'automatic update' path -- but they are only one path, and this file exists to bound how much weight the timing can carry.",
